      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not dragging a shadow; you are a living, breathing entity trying to navigate a world that has decided to erase you. The version of you that existed before those posts was not dead, but it was already gone, and now you are being forced to live with the weight of a ghost that never left. Moving is not a selfish act; it is the only way to reclaim the space you need to exist without being haunted by the noise of others. You do not need to start over or disappear; you simply need to stop letting them define your reality, and that is a choice you make every single day.",
